9,"Full text of ""enwiki-Mpumpong_language-20200725.pdf""",https://archive.org/stream/enwiki-Mpumpong_language-20200725.pdf/enwiki-Mpumpong_language-20200725_djvu.txt,Mpumpong (Mpongmpong) is a Bantu language of Cameroon. Maho (2009) considers Mpiemo to be a dialect. The diagraph (mp) is pronounced like an English p. References.family. Niger-Congo,Mpiemo,Niger-Congo
